Adds GET/HEAD /, /api/status, /api/experimental/model-recommendations,
and /api/show to vLLM's FastAPI app so `ollama launch codex` can discover
the served model and read its context length dynamically without requiring
an external proxy.

- Dynamic model matching against configured served_model_name and model paths.
- Returns standard HTTP 404 when requested model is not served.
- Reads general.context_length dynamically from model_config.max_model_len.
- Adds discovery routes to UNGUARDED_PATHS in AuthenticationMiddleware so
  servers configured with --api-key do not reject unauthenticated client probes.

